{
  "about": "Game terms that are drawn with their icon in front of them wherever they appear in card text. Icons are the #i-* symbols of the Entrika icon sprite. Ids follow the manual (term.*, card.*).",
  "match": {
    "rule": "A stem matches at the start of a word and runs on through any following letters, so Turkish suffixes stay attached (Nüfuzu, Vekile, Divan'da). Matching is case-sensitive: list a lowercase stem only where the term is written in lowercase in running text. Try longer stems first, so Saray Dedikodusu wins over Saray and Birinci Vekil over Vekil.",
    "regex": "(?<![\\p{L}\\p{N}])(STEMS)(?:['’]\\p{L}+|\\p{L}*)",
    "flags": "gu",
    "note": "Use \\p{L} with the u flag, not \\b: \\b treats ı, ş and ğ as word breaks. A short stem also matches longer unrelated words that start with it (Kul in Kullan), so avoid starting a sentence with such a word in card text."
  },
  "terms": [
